      "title": "Read me - experimental MOSS",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "EXPERIMENTAL - native MOSS-Image + Conditioning Layers FIXED composition.\nNot a Krea 2 product profile and not covered by existing compatibility claims.\nQualified once on ComfyUI 0.42.0 with Conditioning Layers 62d9de0; see README.md beside this file.\n\n- Keep 1024x1024: MOSS stores a 64x64 latent grid, so a field is exact only when constant in aligned 2x2 cells of the 128x128 grid.\n- Painted gradients and unaligned FIXED boundaries are not exact.\n- Cover the whole image with positive layers; with CFG above 1 the negative prompt also acts on uncovered regions.\n- MOSS layout JSON is learned placement guidance, not enforced geometric ownership."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "EXPERIMENTAL - native MOSS-Image + Conditioning Layers FIXED composition.\nNot a Krea 2 product profile and not covered by existing compatibility claims.\nQualified once on ComfyUI 0.42.0 with Conditioning Layers 62d9de0; see README.md beside this file.\n\n- Keep 1024x1024: MOSS stores a 64x64 latent grid, so a field is exact only when constant in aligned 2x2 cells of the 128x128 grid.\n- Painted gradients and unaligned FIXED boundaries are not exact.\n- Cover the whole image with positive layers; with CFG above 1 the negative prompt also acts on uncovered regions.\n- MOSS layout JSON is learned placement guidance, not enforced geometric ownership."
